{
  "name": "Slack Content Calendar Reminder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Daily 8AM Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Content Calendar",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Content Calendar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst dueToday = [];\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const row = item.json;\n  const dueDate = row.due_date || row.dueDate || '';\n  const status = (row.status || '').toLowerCase();\n\n  // Check if due today and not already published\n  if (dueDate === today && status !== 'published' && status !== 'done') {\n    dueToday.push({\n      title: row.title || 'Untitled',\n      author: row.author || row.authorSlackId || '',\n      authorSlackId: row.author_slack_id || row.authorSlackId || '',\n      platform: row.platform || 'Blog',\n      contentType: row.content_type || row.contentType || 'Article',\n      status: row.status || 'Draft',\n      dueDate,\n      notes: row.notes || '',\n      rowNumber: row.row_number || ''\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nif (dueToday.length === 0) {\n  return [{json: {hasDue: false, message: 'No content due today'}}];\n}\n\nreturn dueToday.map(item => ({json: {...item, hasDue: true}}));"
      },
      "name": "Filter Due Today",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.hasDue }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "If Content Due",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.authorSlackId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": ":bell: *Content Reminder!*\n\nYou have content due today:\n\n:page_facing_up: *Title:* {{ $json.title }}\n:desktop_computer: *Platform:* {{ $json.platform }}\n:pencil2: *Type:* {{ $json.contentType }}\n:traffic_light: *Status:* {{ $json.status }}\n{{ $json.notes ? '\\n:memo: *Notes:* ' + $json.notes : '' }}\n\nPlease update the content calendar when published!",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "DM Author",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1140, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#content",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":calendar: *Content due today:*\n\n:page_facing_up: *{{ $json.title }}* ({{ $json.platform }})\n:bust_in_silhouette: Author: <@{{ $json.authorSlackId }}>\n:traffic_light: Status: {{ $json.status }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post to Content Channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1140, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Content Calendar",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "reminder_sent": "={{ new Date().toISOString() }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "USER_ENTERED"
        }
      },
      "name": "Update Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1360, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Content Calendar Reminder\n\nDaily content publishing reminders from a shared calendar.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Daily 8AM trigger (weekdays)\n2. Read content calendar from Sheets\n3. Filter items due today that aren't published\n4. DM each author with their due content\n5. Post summary to #content channel\n6. Update reminder_sent timestamp in Sheets\n\n**Sheet columns:**\ntitle, author_slack_id, platform, content_type, status, due_date, notes",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 300
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 8AM Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Content Calendar",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Content Calendar": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Due Today",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Due Today": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "If Content Due",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "If Content Due": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DM Author",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post to Content Channel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "DM Author": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}